== what this shows ==
The package's install scriptlet must restart the user units during the
pacman transaction, before scripts/install-machine's own restart step.
Two stop/start pairs seconds apart are therefore expected: the first is
the scriptlet, the second is step 4 of the installer. One pair would mean
the scriptlet did nothing and the restart came from the installer alone.

